msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... A-Arf... Arf..."
msgstr "... 아-아프... 아프..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... And that was how I broke up with my latest boytoy."
msgstr "...그렇게 해서 내가 내 마지막 남자애완이랑 헤어지게 된 거야."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "... B-but?"
msgstr "... 하지만...?"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Hah..."
msgstr "...하..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "... Honestly I have no idea, dear. I just know she liked coming here and curling up on the ledge. Maybe it was the view... or the smells."
msgstr "...솔직히 전혀 모르겠어, 자기. 그냥 그녀가 여기 오는 걸 좋아했고, 난간 위에 말고 뒹굴던 건 알 뿐이야. 아마 풍경 때문이었을지도... 아니면 냄새 때문이었을지도."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... I think so!"
msgstr "... 그런 것 같아!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "... I... Perhaps."
msgstr "...나... 아마도."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Interesting. I haven't seen anyone crack open one of those suitcases before. It seems you're not a complete failure after all."
msgstr "...흥미롭군. 그런 가방을 여는 사람은 본 적이 없는데. 그래도 네가 완전히 쓸모없는 놈은 아니었나 보네."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Let's agree to never do something like this again."
msgstr "... 다시는 이런 짓 하지 않기로 약속하자."

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>... M-mhmmm...</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>...으... 음...</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "... M-mhmmm..."
msgstr "...으... 음..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "... Nope."
msgstr "... 아니."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "... Please... play with me more... ma'am..."
msgstr "...부탁이에요... 저랑 좀 더 놀아주세요... 아가씨..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Please?"
msgstr "... 제발요?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Proceed."
msgstr "... 계속해."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Right."
msgstr "...그래."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "... Right..."
msgstr "...그래..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Riiiiight..."
msgstr "... 맞아..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Shit."
msgstr "... 젠장."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Whole lotta nothin'."
msgstr "... 완전 허무하네."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Yeah. You were sitting on it the whole time."
msgstr "...응. 네가 계속 그 위에 앉아 있었던 거야."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "... Yeah..."
msgstr "...응..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "... Yes?"
msgstr "...응?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "... Yes? But- You didn't tell me why the spirits are-"
msgstr "...네? 하지만... 영혼들이 왜...라고 말 안 했잖아요..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Enforcer"
msgid "... or not."
msgstr "... 아니면 아니야. (발표자: 집행관, 남성)"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... upward..."
msgstr "...위로..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "...! I-... I- wont-...! Khh..."
msgstr "...! 나... 나는 안...! 흐..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "...- so he said, yeah. Installed new cameras too."
msgstr "...라고 했어, 응. 새 카메라도 설치했고."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Brad"
msgid "...Did any of my neighbors see you going down there?"
msgstr "...내 이웃들 중에 네가 저 아래로 내려가는 걸 본 사람 있니? (말하는 사람: 브래드)"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "...I'm glad."
msgstr "...기분 좋다."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "...Something's wrong but I can't prove it."
msgstr "...무언가 잘못됐지만, 증명할 수는 없어."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "...Thanks, by the way. For what you did before..."
msgstr "...아, 참고로 고마워. 아까 해준 거..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "...Thanks, by the way. For yesterday..."
msgstr "...참, 고마워. 어제 일은..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "...Why do you talk like that, though?"
msgstr "...근데 왜 그렇게 말하는 거야?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "...Yes. That is my fetish. And public display of a fetish is only punishable with a warning."
msgstr "...네. 그게 제 페티시예요. 그리고 페티시를 공개적으로 드러내는 건 경고로만 처벌될 뿐이에요."

