msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Once it's lifted, wait for my call and I'll tell you when to bring it in. Got it?"
msgstr "봉쇄가 풀리면 내 전화를 기다려. 그때 가져오라고 알려줄게. 알았지?"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ondine"
msgstr "온디네"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Rugnar"
msgid "One fifty."
msgstr "일백. (발화자: Rugnar)"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "One hundred for the room and fifty for the service."
msgstr "방값으로 100에 서비스비로 50."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "One hundred thousand? Are you out of your fucking mind?!"
msgstr "십만이라고? 지금 미친 거 아니야?!"

