#. rich_translation: 나중에 봐, <i>토끼야.</i> (말하는 사람: Klaudia, 여성)
msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "See you around, bunny."
msgstr "나중에 봐, 토끼야. (말하는 사람: Klaudia, 여성)"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <size=27>See you around, train slut, ehehe.
#. rich_translation: <size=27>다음에 봐, 기차 내키, 에헤헤.
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "See you around, train slut, ehehe."
msgstr "다음에 봐, 기차 내키, 에헤헤."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Rugnar"
msgid "See you around, waitress."
msgstr "나중에 봐요, 웨이트리스."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Woman"
msgid "See...~ Besides, I think we have a bit of planning to do while Zoey is getting us a marker."
msgstr "보자...~ 게다가 조이가 우리에게 마커를 가져다주는 동안, 약간의 계획이 필요할 것 같아."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "See? Easy!"
msgstr "봤지? 쉬워!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "See? She's fine with it."
msgstr "봐? 그녀는 괜찮아 보이잖아."

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: See? Wasn't that hard, was it? Your purse will be much heavier if you're nice to your customers, <i><b>waitress</b></i>.
#. rich_translation: 봤지? 그렇게 어렵지도 않았잖아? 손님들에게 잘해주면 주머니가 훨씬 더 두둑해질 거야, 웨이트리스.
#, rt-review
msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "See? Wasn't that hard, was it? Your purse will be much heavier if you're nice to your customers, waitress."
msgstr "봤지? 그렇게 어렵지도 않았잖아? 손님들에게 잘해주면 주머니가 훨씬 더 두둑해질 거야, 웨이트리스."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Enforcer"
msgid "Seek her breast, K12."
msgstr "그녀의 가슴을 찾아라, K12. (말하는 사람: 집행관, 남성)"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Seems like this room is under renovation. Perfect place to lay low until they are finally.. <i>done..
